3:["$","div",null,{"className":"mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-14","children":[["$","$L10",null,{"href":"/learning-centre","className":"text-sm font-semibold text-accent hover:text-fg transition-colors","children":"← Learning Centre"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-8 rounded-md border border-border bg-bg-panel p-8 md:p-10","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-4 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-accent","children":"Industry Specific · Service Businesses"}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-fg md:text-5xl","children":"Improve Consultant Landing Pages to Boost High-Ticket Leads"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-5 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"You're running ads or posting content. Traffic is coming in. But almost nobody books the call. The instinct is to tweak the ad creative or try a different platform. The actual problem is on the page - and it almost always starts with asking too much, too soon."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-stretch sm:items-center gap-3","children":[["$","$L10",null,{"href":"/audit?utm_source=learning-centre-coach-consultant-landing-page&utm_medium=hero-cta","className":"inline-flex min-h-[44px] items-center justify-center rounded bg-accent px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-bg transition-opacity hover:opacity-85","children":"Get your free audit →"}],["$","$L10",null,{"href":"/repair-sprint","className":"inline-flex min-h-[44px] items-center justify-center rounded border border-border px-5 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-fg-muted transition-colors hover:border-fg-muted hover:text-fg","children":"Explore $97 Repair Sprint"}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"mt-6 rounded-md border border-border bg-bg-panel p-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-fg","children":"Asking For 30–60 Minutes From A Stranger Is A High-Commitment Ask"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-4 leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"A discovery call is not a low-friction CTA. You're asking someone who has known you for 45 seconds to block out their calendar, show up at a specific time, and have a conversation about their business or life with a person they've never spoken to. That's a significant commitment - and your landing page is doing nothing to make that leap feel safe."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":["The fix isn't to remove the discovery call. It's to stop leading with it. Your page should sell the ",["$","em",null,{"children":"next smallest step"}]," - a free resource, a 15-minute clarity call framed as low-stakes, a quiz that shows them where they're stuck. One step that earns trust. The discovery call happens after that."]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"mt-6 rounded-md border border-border bg-bg-panel p-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-fg","children":"Your Bio Is In The Wrong Place"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-4 leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"On most coach and consultant pages, the structure is: hero → long bio → credentials → testimonials → CTA. Visitors read the bio, feel nothing, and leave. They didn't come to your page to read about you - they came because they have a problem they want solved."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"Flip the order. Lead with the transformation you deliver. Lead with the specific outcome: not \"live your best life\" but \"book 3 new clients in the next 30 days without cold outreach.\" Then show proof that you've done it for others. Then introduce yourself as the person who made that possible. Bio earns authority only after the visitor believes the outcome is real."}]]}],"$L11","$L12","$L13","$L14","$L15"]}]
